# =============================================================================
# EXCHANGE CALENDAR REGISTRY — GITIGNORE
# =============================================================================
# This file tells Git which files and directories to ignore.
# 
# Structure:
#   1. Python
#   2. Virtual Environments
#   3. Test Artifacts
#   4. Build Artifacts
#   5. Language-Specific (JS, Go, Rust)
#   6. Caches and Temporary Files
#   7. IDE and Editor Files
#   8. OS Files
#   9. Project-Specific
#   10. Secrets and Environment
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# 1. PYTHON
# =============================================================================

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

